Data structure / operation	Average time complexity
Array access by index	O(1)
Array search	O(n)
ArrayList get(index)	O(1)
ArrayList contains()	O(n)
HashSet add()	O(1)
HashSet contains()	O(1)
HashMap get()	O(1)
HashMap put()	O(1)
TreeSet add()	O(log n)
TreeMap get()	O(log n)
Sorting	O(n log n)

These are average-case complexities where applicable. HashMap and HashSet operations can degrade to O(n) in collision-heavy worst cases.
